# Inventura: offline + Service Worker rules

- Always assume offline mode is common.
- Never break offline usage when changing UI or data flows.

Service Worker rules:
- If you add/rename/remove static files (HTML/CSS/JS/images), ensure the cache list/version is updated.
- Do NOT cache or intercept mutating API calls (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE).
- For GET requests, prefer safe caching strategies and clear fallbacks when offline.